WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
Now I have food and drink, and someone is there to guarantee it.

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:04,640
Why can't we rely on ourselves from today on?

3
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:17,010
Establish a mutual aid team to divide the work and cooperate. If you are willing to work, it is better to be on my side. We have few people.

4
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:22,980
But don’t be trash Suhao brothers

5
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:26,740
Can I ask you a question? We want to ask it.

6
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:27,980
How do you manage the team?

7
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:33,710
Nowadays, people are divided into two groups. People are divided and cannot do anything. It’s very simple.

8
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:35,790
Either use absolute strength

9
00:00:36,190 --> 00:00:37,470
Let their bodies serve

10
00:00:38,270 --> 00:00:40,030
Whoever disobeys will be beaten until he does

11
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,020
Either use enough wrists

12
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:43,780
Let their spirit serve

13
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:45,460
Let them know from the bottom of their hearts

14
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,180
The only way to survive is by following you

15
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:48,700
To leave you is to die
